  nothing typed, and every single one carried local4. This window also covers four
  severities (crit, err, warning, notice), and each kept its own value: PRI 162, 163, 164
  and 165 are 20*8 plus 2, 3, 4 and 5.

STEP 6 -- removal                                                               PASS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Method: `no log facility` must return the wire to the default facility, and
  `no log host ...` must return it to silence. Both configurations must then be clean,
  proved by reading them, not by the absence of an error.

  The first half was already measured in STEP 3, window 2: with the collectors still
  configured, `no log facility` returned both of them to the original mixture,
  user(1)=9 and syslog(5)=6 on each leg.

awplus# configure terminal
awplus(config)# no log facility
